{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model with multiprofile setting, using pca_n2000 RNA encoding, resnet50 image encoding, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6186 exceeds the singleprofile baseline (config_016, 0.5266), suggesting multiprofile may improve performance. However, the specific contribution of avgpool aggregation versus other methods and the interaction with fusion strategies remain uncertain without direct comparative analysis."
}

